WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.886
The 45th Parliament opened May 26, 2025.

00:00:03.886 --> 00:00:08.068
151 bills introduced as of April 2026.

00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:12.454
The One Canadian Economy Act was rushed to Royal Assent in 20 days flat.

00:00:12.454 --> 00:00:16.113
The Strong Borders Act has stalled at second reading for 7 months.

00:00:16.113 --> 00:00:22.659
Senator Pamela Wallin's MAID reform bill S-231 has not advanced since October 2025.

00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:28.295
The Lawful Access Act 2026 is a new surveillance bill introduced March 2026.
